1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,379
Every stream has its own language.

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:05,537
Its emotes. Its regulars. Its moments.

3
00:00:05,654 --> 00:00:07,534
What if chat could play with all of it?

4
00:00:07,686 --> 00:00:12,189
Meet Emote Exchange. A live emote
market where your community's attention

5
00:00:12,214 --> 00:00:16,589
moves the Prices. Coins are free
play points, with no cash value.

6
00:00:16,741 --> 00:00:20,745
Buy into the moment. Type buy,
an emote name, and a quantity.

7
00:00:20,863 --> 00:00:24,925
Your shares arrive, your balance
updates, and the bot confirms the Trade.

8
00:00:25,112 --> 00:00:28,420
Ready to make a move? Sell
some shares, or sell them all.

9
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:30,521
The Coins return to your balance.

10
00:00:30,638 --> 00:00:35,269
Know where you stand. Portfolio shows
your Coins, Holdings, Net Worth, and

11
00:00:35,294 --> 00:00:38,091
current Streak. P F is the shortcut.

12
00:00:38,324 --> 00:00:42,282
Make showing up count. Check in
with greetings and a few words.

13
00:00:42,469 --> 00:00:45,486
Claim once per Stream: fifty Coins to start.

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,491
Return on consecutive Streams to grow
your Streak, and earn up to a hundred

15
00:00:49,516 --> 00:00:52,034
and forty. Give your regulars a boost.

16
00:00:52,151 --> 00:00:55,691
The streamer can grant Coins from the
dashboard, review the amount, and

17
00:00:55,716 --> 00:01:00,625
confirm. Five hundred Coins, delivered
straight to the Trader, with a reply

18
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:05,142
in chat. Find your next move. Market
shows the hottest tickers and how to

19
00:01:05,167 --> 00:01:07,929
play. Top shows the leading Traders.

20
00:01:08,162 --> 00:01:10,576
One command. A shared scoreboard.

21
00:01:10,693 --> 00:01:15,580
Keep the conversation going. Qualifying
chat earns a minute-by-minute Stipend.

22
00:01:15,813 --> 00:01:20,211
Follows earn a bonus. New chatters
arriving after a Raid can receive a Raid

23
00:01:20,236 --> 00:01:24,020
Visa. Behind every moment, the
streamer stays in control.

24
00:01:24,137 --> 00:01:28,408
Pause trading. Freeze a Trader. Watch
engagement, participation, and the

25
00:01:28,433 --> 00:01:31,253
economy on the Live page. Buy. Sell.

26
00:01:31,278 --> 00:01:34,794
Check in. Build your Streak.
Reward your community.

27
00:01:34,912 --> 00:01:37,883
Emote Exchange. Chat is the market.
